# ── Learning material ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Roadmap, exercises, interview prep, and raw measurement notes. These are
# study aids for me, not part of the software. Benchmark *results* that back a
# claim get promoted into README.md; the working notes stay here.
_learning/

# ── Desktop app scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where the Claude desktop app saves files it hands over. Two copies of the CI
# workflows landed here and got committed — harmless, but a second copy of a
# config file is worse than none: someone eventually edits the wrong one.
Claude outputs/

# ── Dependencies & build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
coverage/
*.local

# ── Playwright ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Traces, screenshots and the HTML report, written only when a test fails.
# Ignored because they are large binary artefacts of ONE run on ONE machine —
# CI uploads them as an artifact instead, which is where a failing run's
# evidence belongs. Note that e2e/ itself and the golden SVGs in
# tests/visual/__golden__/ are NOT ignored: those are source.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# ── Tooling caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vite/
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Editor & OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# ── Environment ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
